            <mxCell id="pm_title" value="Claude Code — Context Architecture" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#212529;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="15" width="1200" height="42" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pm_sub" value="Cross-functional process map — the five lanes on top are where context &lt;b&gt;comes from&lt;/b&gt;; the wide band below is where it is &lt;b&gt;used&lt;/b&gt;. Toggle a flow with the layer panel (&lt;b&gt;Ctrl+Shift+L&lt;/b&gt;)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#495057;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="62" width="2200" height="24" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_ent" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;①&amp;nbsp; Enterprise policy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#495057&quot;&gt;machine-wide · admin-managed · read-only&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#F57C00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#212529;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="120" width="400" height="74" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_mkt" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;②&amp;nbsp; Marketplace&amp;nbsp; ☁&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#495057&quot;&gt;remote git repo · off your machine&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8F0FC;strokeColor=#AE3EC9;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#212529;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="500" y="120" width="360" height="74" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_usr" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;③&amp;nbsp; User scope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#495057&quot;&gt;~/.claude · shared by every project&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#7B1FA2;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#212529;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="920" y="120" width="700" height="74" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_prj" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;④&amp;nbsp; Project scope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#495057&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;/ · committed to the repo&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#212529;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1680" y="120" width="660" height="74" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_bin" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;⑤&amp;nbsp; Claude Binary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#495057&quot;&gt;the executable on disk — Tier 1&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F0FE;strokeColor=#4285F4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#212529;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2400" y="120" width="480" height="74" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sep_1" value="" style="line;direction=north;html=1;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;strokeColor=#CED4DA;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="460.0" y="100" width="20" height="770" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sep_2" value="" style="line;direction=north;html=1;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;strokeColor=#CED4DA;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="880.0" y="100" width="20" height="770" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sep_3" value="" style="line;direction=north;html=1;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;strokeColor=#CED4DA;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1640.0" y="100" width="20" height="770" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sep_4" value="" style="line;direction=north;html=1;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;strokeColor=#CED4DA;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2360.0" y="100" width="20" height="770" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_hrn" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;⑥&amp;nbsp; Tier · Harness — runtime on your machine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#495057&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;· every lane above converges here · the only lane that talks to ⑦&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#212529;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="900" width="2840" height="74" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_mdl" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;⑦&amp;nbsp; Model&amp;nbsp; ☁&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#495057&quot;&gt;Anthropic API — Tier 3&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8F0FC;strokeColor=#AE3EC9;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#212529;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2980" y="120" width="380" height="74" /></mxCell><mxCell id="end_reply" value="⏹&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Done → reply to user&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;no more tool calls · session idle&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EBFBEE;strokeColor=#2F9E44;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1700" y="1055" width="300" height="84" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_done" value="⑤ no tool requested → answer" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;strokeColor=#2F9E44;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2F9E44;fontSize=9;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="ly_model" source="al_verify" target="end_reply"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend_shapes" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Shape legend — ISO 5807&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;⬭&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Oval&lt;/b&gt; — start / end of the process ($ claude · Done)&lt;br&gt;▭&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Rectangle&lt;/b&gt; — a step, a component or a config artefact&lt;br&gt;◇&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Diamond&lt;/b&gt; — decision with branches (Permission gate)&lt;br&gt;▱&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Parallelogram&lt;/b&gt; — input / output (Your prompt)&lt;br&gt;⛁&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Cylinder&lt;/b&gt; — stored data (&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;.jsonl · external DB / API)&lt;br&gt;🗀&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Folder&lt;/b&gt; — an on-disk file or directory&lt;br&gt;▤&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Swimlane box&lt;/b&gt; — a container that groups its children&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#ADB5BD;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#212529;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1420" width="400" height="180" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend_layers" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Flow layers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#868e96&quot;&gt; — Ctrl+Shift+L to toggle&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Flow 1 · Plugin marketplace &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; Flow 2 · Startup + Context auto-load&lt;br&gt;Flow 3 · Subagent (load + spawn) &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; Flow 4 · Model call&lt;br&gt;Flow 5 · MCP call &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; Flow 6 · Session persistence (jsonl)&lt;br&gt;Flow 7 · Context compaction&lt;br&gt;Flow · Hooks load (merge) &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; Flow · Hooks trigger (event-driven)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Every flow layer is locked so the background layout cannot be dragged.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#ADB5BD;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#212529;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1625" width="820" height="150" /></mxCell></root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="4d-framework" name="4D Framework">
        <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="760" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2500" pageHeight="700" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0" />
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
                <mxCell id="fd_title" value="4D Framework for AI Fluency" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f2937;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="125" width="900" height="32" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_sub" value="A framework about &lt;b&gt;user skills&lt;/b&gt; — not a Claude Code mechanism" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#6b7280;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="161" width="900" height="22" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_lblfb" value="Typical working sequence — evaluation results lead to the next delegation" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;fontColor=#868e96;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1000" y="177" width="640" height="20" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_d1" value="&lt;b&gt;D1 · Delegation&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Decide whether / when / how to delegate to AI&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;In the architecture:&lt;/b&gt; choose surface (CLI · IDE · web — also decides whether Tier 2 runs on your machine or an Anthropic VM) ·&lt;br&gt;choose model · edit yourself or let the agent · whether to split Subagents&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1f2937;fillColor=#d0ebff;strokeColor=#1971c2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="225" width="760" height="200" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_d2" value="&lt;b&gt;D2 · Description&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Express the goal so the AI does it right&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Prompting lives here&lt;/b&gt; — and is only part of this D&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;In the architecture:&lt;/b&gt; Your prompt (transient) ·&lt;br&gt;CLAUDE.md · rules/ · skills/ · commands/ = Description made durable: write once, reuse many times&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1f2937;fillColor=#d3f9d8;strokeColor=#2f9e44;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="840" y="225" width="760" height="200" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_d3" value="&lt;b&gt;D3 · Discernment&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Evaluate quality, correctness, bias of the output&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;In the architecture:&lt;/b&gt; the Verify results step in the Agentic Loop · read the diff before accepting ·&lt;br&gt;run tests / lint · don't trust the agent's report without checking&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1f2937;fillColor=#fff3bf;strokeColor=#e8a33d;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1640" y="225" width="760" height="200" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_d4" value="&lt;b&gt;D4 · Diligence&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;— applies to all three steps above, not a separate step&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Take responsibility for using AI and how — including governance, ethics, safety&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mechanized in the architecture:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Permission gate (allow / ask / deny) · Hooks · settings.json committed for the team · Enterprise managed policy ★&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cannot be mechanized:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; transparency about what the AI wrote · accountability at merge · knowing when to stop&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1f2937;fillColor=#e5dbff;strokeColor=#7048e8;strokeWidth=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="465" width="2360" height="170" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_note" value="&lt;b&gt;About the 4D framework&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;— Authors: Prof Rick Dakan (Ringling College of Art and Design) &amp;amp; Prof Joseph Feller (University College Cork); used in Anthropic's AI Fluency course.&lt;br&gt;— Source: aifluencyframework.org · anthropic.skilljar.com/ai-fluency-framework-foundations&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;— The original framework describes the four D's as &lt;b&gt;four interdependent competencies&lt;/b&gt;, with no mandatory order. The sequence arrows and loop here are an interpretation for drawing, not a statement of the framework.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;— Each box's color matches the corresponding component in the architecture page: D4 purple = Permission gate / settings.json, D2 green = CLAUDE.md.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#adb5bd;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=13;fontColor=#495057;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="655" width="2360" height="150" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_f1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;curved=1;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#495057;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="fd_d1" target="fd_d2" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_f2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;curved=1;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#495057;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="fd_d2" target="fd_d3" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fd_fb" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;curved=1;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#868e96;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="fd_d3" target="fd_d1" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="2020" y="203" />
                            <mxPoint x="420" y="203" />
                        </Array>
